    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>As an EO</b>, <b>I want to record supporting information against evidence I have received</b> <b>So I have a summary of rationale to support a decision to approve or decline at determination</b>.</p>

<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Detail</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Description</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><b>User Group</b></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Eligibility Officer (EO).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><b>Process</b></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>2.4.2 Collate evidence as supporting information.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>


<p><b>Acceptance Criteria (AC)</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>The system must allow an EO to select evidence items under the 'Evidence Received' tab.</li>
</ol>


<ol>
	<li>Within the Evidence item, the system must allow the EO to <b>add comments under Supporting Information</b>.</li>
</ol>


<ol>
	<li>The user must be able to record supporting information under the following categories while viewing the document:</li>
</ol>


<p>    ◦ <b>Reason for Approval</b>.</p>

<p>    ◦ <b>Reason for Decline</b>.</p>

<p>    ◦ <b>Other Comments</b>.</p>



<p>Design System: <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/OfP0MHg46hwyfMlqgI5sO0/Legal-Aid-Salesforce-Design-System?node-id=0-1&amp;p=f" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.figma.com/design/OfP0MHg46hwyfMlqgI5sO0/Legal-Aid-Salesforce-Design-System?node-id=0-1&amp;p=f</a></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
